  "description": "Army mariners on Logistics Support Vessel 3, the General Brehon B. Somervell, 8th Special Troops Battalion, 8th Theater Sustainment Command, conducts overwater hoist operations with the 25th Combat Aviation Brigade, Jan. 24-25, 2024, in the waters off of Oahu, Hawaii. The two-day training cumulated with live personnel being retrieved from the water in an overboard scenario. (U.S. Army video by Spc. Devin Davis)",
